## 2. Rust dependencies

This section is generated from the Cargo dependency graph for the
`aarch64-apple-darwin` release build using `cargo about` 0.9.3.
It lists every Rust crate that is compiled into MacUtl or its bundled
plugins, together with the license text that applies.

Dual-licensed crates are used under the most permissive option. In
particular, `self_cell` is used under Apache-2.0 (not GPL-2.0-only) and
`r-efi` is used under MIT (not LGPL-2.1-or-later).

